# Sphinx documentation
docs/_build/
docs/*
# ...but not hand-written docs. `docs/*` is aimed at GENERATED Sphinx output and
# swallows everything else in the folder with it, silently — a research report
# committed here simply did not appear in `git status`. Un-ignore the authored
# subfolders explicitly rather than narrowing the rule, so generated output stays
# ignored by default and anything hand-written has to be opted in on purpose.
!docs/research/
!docs/learner-model-design.md

